{"id":"b793f1206588410b","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-density-tail.md","title":"柱集密度与尾事件","display":"df-density-tail — 柱集密度与尾事件","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-density-tail","aliases":["43-df-density-tail"],"display":"df-density-tail — 柱集密度与尾事件","depends_on":["[[43-df-cylinder]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Definition 4.2.2 and paragraph before Theorem 4.2.4, print pp.4–5 / PDF pp.24–25","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"definition-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-density-tail"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-density-tail</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-density-tail — 柱集密度与尾事件"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Definition 4.2.2 and paragraph before Theorem 4.2.4, print pp.4–5 / PDF pp.24–25"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a> 的公平硬币 Borel 概率空间；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\">\\(E\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in[0,1]\">\\(d\\in[0,1]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma X\">\\(\\sigma X\\)</span>为有限串与无限序列的拼接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Density}(E,X,d)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(n\\ge N\\Rightarrow\\left|2^n\\mu(E\\cap[X\\upharpoonright n])-d\\right|\\le2^{-k}\\right),\\qquad\\Xi(E):=\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\operatorname{Density}(E,X,1)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Density}(E,X,d)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(n\\ge N\\Rightarrow\\left|2^n\\mu(E\\cap[X\\upharpoonright n])-d\\right|\\le2^{-k}\\right),\\qquad\\Xi(E):=\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\operatorname{Density}(E,X,1)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tail}(E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in2^n\\ \\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\ (\\sigma X\\in E\\leftrightarrow\\tau X\\in E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Tail}(E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in2^n\\ \\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\ (\\sigma X\\in E\\leftrightarrow\\tau X\\in E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>尾事件对同长度初始段的替换不变；密度绑定公平硬币测度与具体柱集。密度使用趋于零的有理误差界展开收敛条件，对不收敛的候选也定义为假，不调用未定义的极限值；Ξ 的集合构造显式限于 Cantor 空间。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 4.2.2 and paragraph before Theorem 4.2.4, print pp.4–5 / PDF pp.24–25。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mu$ 与 $\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 采用 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的公平硬币 Borel 概率空间；$E\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$，$X\\in2^\\omega$、$d\\in[0,1]$；$\\sigma X$为有限串与无限序列的拼接。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"E\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Density}(E,X,d)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(n\\ge N\\Rightarrow\\left|2^n\\mu(E\\cap[X\\upharpoonright n])-d\\right|\\le2^{-k}\\right),\\qquad\\Xi(E):=\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\operatorname{Density}(E,X,1)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Tail}(E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in2^n\\ \\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\ (\\sigma X\\in E\\leftrightarrow\\tau X\\in E).","display":true}],"bytes":1628,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-density-tail]] — 柱集密度与尾事件"},{"id":"00a1afe6095bcabc","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-density-tail]]。"},{"id":"69e3b28dcc6d43ac","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-density-tail]]、[[43-df-cylinder]]。"}],"outgoing":["ab1ef7b1cac112c1"]}